Subject: [PATCH] drm/apple: do not latch crashed on a poweroff swap timeout

Keep the clear-swap timeout control flow but leave the permanent crash flag
for the RTKit crash callback. Warn when the clear swap does not complete.

Timeout semantics by Francisco Vargas <haripako@gmail.com>.

---
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/iomfb_template.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/apple/iomfb_template.c
@@ -930,7 +930,9 @@ void DCP_FW_NAME(iomfb_poweroff)(struct apple_dcp *dcp)
 	swap_id = cookie->swap_id;
 	kref_put(&cookie->refcount, release_swap_cookie);
 	if (ret <= 0) {
-		dcp->crashed = true;
+		dev_warn(dcp->dev,
+			 "%s: timed out waiting for the poweroff clear swap; continuing\n",
+			 __func__);
 		return;
 	}
 
